            <note corresp="#d64-f1" n="1" type="source" xml:id="d64-f1-content">
                <p>Repeated to Paris for the Embassy and OSR, to the other NATO capitals, to
                    Heidelberg for Handy, and to Wiesbaden for Norstad.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d64-f2" n="2" xml:id="d64-f2-content">
                <p>The reference here is to telegram Depto 711, <hi rendition="#italic"
